Login qanday ishlaydi

1. Login/Register muvaffaqiyatli bo‘lsa → token va user ni Zustand + localStorage ga saqlang.
2. Har bir GraphQL so‘rovga qo‘shing: Authorization: Bearer <token>

Sevimli (`isFavorite`)

Har bir Listing da isFavorite maydoni/fieldi bor (`true` / `false`).

- Login qilmagan bo‘lsangiz → doim false
- Login qilgan bo‘lsangiz → shu uy sevimlida bo‘lsa true

Nima qilasiz: Home, Listings, Detail so‘rovlarida isFavorite ni ham so‘rang. ❤️ shu qiymatga qarab to‘ldirilgan yoki bo‘sh ko‘rinsin.

# misol
{
  id
  title
  images
  pricePerNight
  isFavorite
}


❤️ bosilganda:
- isFavorite === false → addFavorite(listingId)
- isFavorite === true → removeFavorite(listingId)
- kirmagan bo‘lsa → toast + /login

Sahifalarni himoya qilish (`App.jsx`)

import { Navigate, Route, Routes } from "react-router-dom";
import { useAuthStore } from "./store/authStore";

function FaqatKirgan({ children }) {
  const token = useAuthStore((s) => s.accessToken);
  return token ? children : <Navigate to="/login" replace />;
}

function FaqatKirmagan({ children }) {
  const token = useAuthStore((s) => s.accessToken);
  return token ? <Navigate to="/" replace /> : children;
}

function FaqatAdmin({ children }) {
  const { accessToken, user } = useAuthStore();
  if (!accessToken) return <Navigate to="/login" replace />;
  if (user?.role !== "ADMIN") return <Navigate to="/" replace />;
  return children;
}

export default function App() {
  return (
    <Routes>
      <Route path="/" element={<HomePage />} />
      <Route path="/listings" element={<ListingsPage />} />
      <Route path="/listings/:id" element={<ListingDetailPage />} />

      <Route path="/login" element={<FaqatKirmagan><LoginPage /></FaqatKirmagan>} />
      <Route path="/register" element={<FaqatKirmagan><RegisterPage /></FaqatKirmagan>} />

      <Route path="/favorites" element={<FaqatKirgan><FavoritesPage /></FaqatKirgan>} />
      <Route path="/bookings" element={<FaqatKirgan><BookingsPage /></FaqatKirgan>} />

      <Route path="/admin" element={<FaqatAdmin><AdminPage /></FaqatAdmin>} />

      <Route path="*" element={<NotFoundPage />} />
    </Routes>
  );
}


Navbar: kirmagan → Login/Register; kirgan → Sevimlilar, Bronlar, User avatar va ism, chiqish/sign out.

Dizayn (umumiy)

- Oddiy, toza UI
- Kartochkalar gridda; telefonda ham chiroyli
- Yuklanayotganda Skeleton yoki spinner
- Bo‘sh bo‘lsa: “Hali hech narsa yo‘q” + tugma
- Muvaffaqiyat/xato → Toast
- Dizayn mukammal bo‘lishi shart emas — asosiysi ishlashi

1) Bosh sahifa /

Nima ko‘rinadi:
- Qisqa sarlavha + “Uylarni ko‘rish” tugmasi
- Tanlangan uylar/Tavsiya etilgan uylar (`featuredListings`, ~6 ta)
- Kartada: rasm, nom, joy, yulduzcha, narx, ❤️ (`isFavorite` bo‘yicha)

Nima qilish kerak:
- Kartaga bosilsa → /listings/:id
- ❤️ → addFavorite / removeFavorite (yoki login)

2) Barcha uylar /listings

Nima ko‘rinadi:
- Filter: search, tur/category (`APARTMENT`, HOUSE, VILLA, CABIN, `HOTEL`), joy/location, min/max narx
- Uylar ro‘yxati + pagination
- Har bir kartada isFavorite bo‘yicha ❤️

3) Uy tafsiloti /listings/:id

Nima ko‘rinadi:
- Rasmlar
- Nom, joy, manzil, tur
- Yulduzcha va sharhlar soni (faqat ko‘rsatish)
- Mehmonlar, yotoqxona, karavot, hammom
- Tavsif va qulayliklar
- ❤️ (`listing.isFavorite`)
- Bron qilish cardi: sanalar, mehmonlar, jami narx, “Bron qilish”

Nima qilish kerak:
- Form: chiqish sanasi kirishdan keyin; mehmonlar 1 dan uy sig‘imigacha
- Muvaffaqiyat → toast + /bookings
- Xato → toast
- Kirmagan bron qilsa → /login 4) Kirish /login

Nima ko‘rinadi: email, parol, “Kirish”, Register havolasi

Nima qilish kerak:
- Form tekshiruvi
- Muvaffaqiyat → token saqlash → bosh sahifa
- Xato → toast
- Allaqachon kirgan → bosh sahifa

5) Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish /register

Nima ko‘rinadi: ism, email, parol, parolni takrorlash

Nima qilish kerak:
- Parollar bir xil bo‘lsin
- Muvaffaqiyat → avtomatik kirish → bosh sahifa
- Email band bo‘lsa → toast

6) Sevimlilar /favorites (login kerak)

Nima ko‘rinadi: sevimli uylar (`favorites` so‘rovi)

Nima qilish kerak:
- Token yo‘q → /login
- Bo‘sh bo‘lsa → “Uylarni ko‘rish” tugmasi
- ❤️ bilan olib tashlash (`removeFavorite`)
- Kartaga bosilsa → tafsilot

7) Mening bronlarim /bookings (login kerak)

Nima ko‘rinadi: har bir bron:
- Uy rasmi, nomi, joyi
- Sanalar, mehmonlar, kechalar, jami narx
- Holat: CONFIRMED yoki CANCELLED
- Bekor qilish (faqat `CONFIRMED`)

😍 Admin /admin (faqat admin)

Admin uchun alohida sign in page qilasizlar. Admin uchun login va parol: email: admin@example.com,
password: admin123

Nima ko‘rinadi:
1. Mavjud uylar ro‘yxati
2. Yangi uy qo‘shish formasi (**majburiy**)

Formada:
- title, description, category
- location, address
- pricePerNight, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms
- images (rasm URL lari — yuklash yo‘q)
- amenities
- isFeatured

Formaga qo‘ymang: rating, reviewsCount — backend o‘zi boshqaradi.